From 00b36406552fe7a66aecc11c1914ffb366dd4c66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:03:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/14] ABI v2: custody accounts, instructions, records and
 errors

Lot account (kind 23, entity 13, seed cl + hex of a 15-byte key), the
custody fields taken from the Vault and Caravan reserves (no account
grows), tags 0xC1-0xCB, their data, account lists and placeholder
budgets, log kinds 104-112 with their chains (LOT_* and the Lot's
CLOSE), error codes 94-98. Vectors regenerated. Custody instructions are
not relay shapes.

Renumbered to workstream 4's allocation rev 4 (ABI-ALLOCATION-20261106,
provisional), on the integration candidate c1e8137e beside workstream 8's
ExtendFrontier (0xC1, FRONTIER_EXTENDED 104, ContinuousWorld 94) and
workstream 20's residents: tags 0xC2-0xCC, record kinds 105-113, errors
100-104 (CqError::ALL in code order; the unallocated range is now
105..=169). AccountKind 23, entity 13 and seed `cl` are unchanged.
Vectors regenerated with abi-vectors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C5Nj2cMNVbfXW4D5Pzsbxg
